---
// Home page hero: title, tagline, Start Here button, one-line description.
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-wrapper">
      <h1 class="hero-title">
        Technology's True Cost
      </h1>
      <span class="hero-subtitle">When it breaks. When it breaks us. What keeps me standing.</span>
      
      <div class="hero-buttons">
        <a href="/start-here/" class="button button-primary">
          <ion-icon name="rocket-outline"></ion-icon>
          Start Here
        </a>
      </div>
      
      <p class="hero-description">
        Azure, governance, and platform patterns. I'm taking notes.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 1rem 0;
    text-align: center;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-primary) 0%, var(--bg-secondary) 100%);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }

  .hero::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(circle at 20% 50%, rgba(33, 150, 243, 0.03) 0%, transparent 50%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 80% 80%, rgba(33, 150, 243, 0.03) 0%, transparent 50%);
  }

  .hero-wrapper {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1rem 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-title {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
    font-size: 48px;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--text-heading);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 10px;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    font-size: 42px;
    color: var(--accent-color);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-buttons {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-buttons .button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .hero-buttons .button ion-icon {
    font-size: 20px;
  }

  .hero-description {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    text-align: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .hero-title {
      font-size: 36px;
    }

    .hero-subtitle {
      font-size: 32px;
    }
  }
</style>
